1
00:00:00,787 --> 00:00:05,192
Welcome to Wabi Insight,
from WabiTex Solutions.

2
00:00:06,043 --> 00:00:07,702
Over the next ten minutes,

3
00:00:07,752 --> 00:00:12,564
we will take you through the platform
exactly as it runs on the live site,

4
00:00:12,614 --> 00:00:15,784
and as your employees will
use it: on a computer,

5
00:00:15,834 --> 00:00:18,084
and just as comfortably on a phone.

6
00:00:19,434 --> 00:00:21,154
This is the landing page.

7
00:00:21,204 --> 00:00:26,676
Wabi Insight lets your employees ask
questions about your organization's data,

8
00:00:26,726 --> 00:00:31,419
in English or Arabic, and get
verified answers, charts and reports.

9
00:00:32,681 --> 00:00:35,610
The platform works with most database systems.

10
00:00:36,498 --> 00:00:42,248
Every query is read-only, and every person
sees what they are permitted to see,

11
00:00:42,298 --> 00:00:43,496
and nothing more.

12
00:00:44,318 --> 00:00:49,965
Before the first question, your organization's
administrator sets everything up:

13
00:00:50,015 --> 00:00:55,306
applications, users and permissions,
over encrypted, read-only connections.

14
00:00:56,188 --> 00:01:01,047
Our support team is ready to help, with
your approval and in your presence,

15
00:01:01,097 --> 00:01:02,880
and it never sees your data.

16
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,436
Now we sign in as one of the managers.

17
00:01:06,486 --> 00:01:11,128
Sign-in is protected: an encrypted
connection, a secure session,

18
00:01:11,178 --> 00:01:14,794
and protection against
repeated password attempts.

19
00:01:15,661 --> 00:01:20,398
And if a password is forgotten,
a reset link is sent by email,

20
00:01:20,448 --> 00:01:22,329
valid for thirty minutes.

21
00:01:23,991 --> 00:01:29,499
This is the manager's dashboard: the
latest questions, saved reports and alerts,

22
00:01:29,549 --> 00:01:32,348
and all of it belongs to this user alone.

23
00:01:33,170 --> 00:01:35,216
This is the heart of the platform.

24
00:01:35,266 --> 00:01:39,223
Choose the application, then ask.
You can type your own question,

25
00:01:39,273 --> 00:01:41,690
or start from one of the suggested ones.

26
00:01:44,603 --> 00:01:50,099
Within seconds, Wabi Insight gives you
a written explanation, the key figures,

27
00:01:50,149 --> 00:01:51,734
and a table of results.

28
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:57,484
Behind the scenes, the AI never
writes a query against the database.

29
00:01:57,534 --> 00:01:59,226
It only proposes a plan.

30
00:02:00,107 --> 00:02:05,029
The platform then checks that plan against
the permissions of the person asking,

31
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:08,821
builds a safe, read-only query,
and runs it on your database.

32
00:02:08,871 --> 00:02:11,680
Every number you see comes from your own data.

33
00:02:12,504 --> 00:02:15,939
And you do not have to take
the answer on trust alone.

34
00:02:15,989 --> 00:02:21,166
This section explains in plain language
which data was used, how it was filtered,

35
00:02:21,216 --> 00:02:23,295
and how the calculation was made.

36
00:02:24,119 --> 00:02:28,425
Now let's ask about another
system: payroll cost by department.

37
00:02:28,475 --> 00:02:32,849
The question is just as simple,
the database is a different one,

38
00:02:32,899 --> 00:02:35,200
and the answer comes with a chart.

39
00:02:36,067 --> 00:02:38,866
The manager sees the whole organization.

40
00:02:38,916 --> 00:02:44,065
A section head asking the same question
would see only their own section,

41
00:02:44,115 --> 00:02:46,842
and an employee only their own records.

42
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:51,692
The platform applies these
rules automatically, every time.

43
00:02:52,513 --> 00:02:56,264
And when you need the full
picture, ask for a dashboard.

44
00:02:56,314 --> 00:02:57,825
From a single question,

45
00:02:57,875 --> 00:03:02,304
Wabi Insight brings several verified
queries together in one view.

46
00:03:03,793 --> 00:03:06,022
Key indicators, charts and tables,

47
00:03:06,072 --> 00:03:09,508
with a written explanation
of what the numbers show.

48
00:03:09,558 --> 00:03:13,531
All of it within your permissions,
as with any other answer.

49
00:03:14,353 --> 00:03:20,106
Wabi Insight is fully bilingual. One
click switches the interface to Arabic,

50
00:03:20,156 --> 00:03:22,244
laid out from right to left.

51
00:03:23,119 --> 00:03:27,124
Let's ask in Arabic this time.
The question is just as simple,

52
00:03:27,174 --> 00:03:29,479
and the answer comes back in Arabic.

53
00:03:31,988 --> 00:03:34,347
Ask in either language, and the answer,

54
00:03:34,397 --> 00:03:38,920
the table and the report come in the
language you asked in, on any screen.

55
00:03:41,714 --> 00:03:45,357
You can take any answer
with you: as a PDF report,

56
00:03:45,407 --> 00:03:51,119
a Word document or an Excel sheet,
carrying your organization's name and logo.

57
00:03:53,665 --> 00:03:59,081
Nothing is lost. Every answer is saved
in your history, with its versions.

58
00:03:59,950 --> 00:04:04,659
Run it again later, and the new
result is added beside the old one.

59
00:04:04,709 --> 00:04:06,150
It never replaces it.

60
00:04:07,005 --> 00:04:09,636
Keep what matters most in your favorites,

61
00:04:09,686 --> 00:04:12,447
and group related answers into collections.

62
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:17,253
Sharing is handled with the same care.

63
00:04:17,303 --> 00:04:20,868
Share an answer with a
colleague, or send it by email.

64
00:04:22,443 --> 00:04:27,739
The platform checks what the recipient is
entitled to see before anything is sent.

65
00:04:28,811 --> 00:04:34,440
So no one can obtain through sharing any
data they could not have obtained by asking

66
00:04:34,490 --> 00:04:35,184
themselves.

67
00:04:36,035 --> 00:04:38,903
You can revoke any share whenever you wish,

68
00:04:38,953 --> 00:04:41,958
and every share is recorded in the audit log.

69
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:46,569
The reports page gathers the
documents you have generated,

70
00:04:46,619 --> 00:04:48,688
ready to open or download again.

71
00:04:49,512 --> 00:04:53,118
Wabi Insight keeps working
even when you are not asking.

72
00:04:53,168 --> 00:04:56,971
With monitoring rules, you
describe what should be watched,

73
00:04:57,021 --> 00:05:00,367
such as one account being
used from several devices.

74
00:05:01,236 --> 00:05:03,679
The platform checks on the schedule you set,

75
00:05:03,729 --> 00:05:06,853
and raises an alert when
something needs your attention.

76
00:05:07,736 --> 00:05:12,449
Every rule runs with its owner's
permissions and never exceeds them.

77
00:05:12,499 --> 00:05:17,913
Alerts only inform you; the decision and
the action always stay with a person.

78
00:05:18,778 --> 00:05:23,518
Open the alert to see what was detected
and why, then record your note,

79
00:05:23,568 --> 00:05:25,340
and close it once reviewed.

80
00:05:26,162 --> 00:05:31,696
Periodic reports reach you on a regular
schedule: daily, weekly or monthly.

81
00:05:31,746 --> 00:05:37,429
Each recipient receives their own copy,
prepared under their own permissions.

82
00:05:38,250 --> 00:05:43,005
Notifications keep you informed, the
support desk connects you with our team,

83
00:05:43,055 --> 00:05:46,687
and your profile holds your
language and password settings.

84
00:05:49,769 --> 00:05:55,495
Because trust is the foundation of
everything, here is what protects your data.

85
00:05:55,545 --> 00:05:59,735
Your organization is completely
isolated from every other.

86
00:05:59,785 --> 00:06:04,707
Permissions apply at the level of
the table, the column and the row.

87
00:06:05,581 --> 00:06:10,708
The AI never runs a query it has
written, and every query is read-only.

88
00:06:10,758 --> 00:06:13,114
Connection details are encrypted,

89
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:18,072
and every action is recorded in an
audit log that cannot be altered.

90
00:06:19,841 --> 00:06:22,245
Your data stays under your control.

91
00:06:22,295 --> 00:06:27,573
Wabi Insight can run in the cloud, or
on your own servers, at your premises,

92
00:06:27,623 --> 00:06:28,555
if you prefer.

93
00:06:29,406 --> 00:06:34,686
Either way, our team is with you from day
one: we install the platform with you,

94
00:06:34,736 --> 00:06:38,084
connect your systems, set
up roles and permissions,

95
00:06:38,134 --> 00:06:42,681
and stay by your side until your
employees work with full confidence.

96
00:06:44,425 --> 00:06:48,341
Wabi Insight. Ask your data. Trust the answer.

97
00:06:49,221 --> 00:06:51,921
To see the platform working on your own data,

98
00:06:51,971 --> 00:06:56,260
scan the code to save our contact
details, or get in touch at any time.

99
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:58,338
We would be glad to hear from you.

100
00:06:58,388 --> 00:06:59,744
Thank you for watching.
